<title>FINLAND: VALTAMERI SIX-MONTH PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>VALTAMERI SIX-MONTH PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     5.8 vs 7.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.50 vs 3.80</p>
<p> Net sales					   18.2 vs 16.2</p>
<p> Operating profit				   5.6 vs 6.8</p>
<p> Share of profits of associated companies   7.2 vs 11.6</p>
